# Store every file byte-for-byte. No end-of-line conversion anywhere.
#
# This project keeps SHA-256 hashes of datasets, annotations and signed
# deliverables as evidence (see Context/ and Dataset/annotations/), and the
# submitted report is the source of truth. A checkout on any platform must
# therefore return exactly the bytes that were committed.
* -text

# Binary formats: never diff or merge as text.
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.pptx  binary
*.zip   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.HEIC  binary
*.heic  binary
*.mp4   binary
*.safetensors binary
*.pt    binary
*.pth   binary
*.joblib binary
*.npy   binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.traineddata binary
